#. <CLT 4>桜の木が植えられている。しかも満開だ。
#. キレイだけど…なんだかな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This cherry tree is in full bloom. It's really pretty,\n"
"but somehow...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>桜の木が植えられている。しかも満開だ。
#. キレイだけど…なんだかな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This cherry tree is in full bloom. It's really pretty,\n"
"but somehow...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>木製のロッカーがある…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's a bunch of wooden lockers in here.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それぞれのロッカーに木の札が差し込まれている。
#. これが鍵になってるんだろうな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Each of them has a traditional-looking woodblock key\n"
"sticking out of it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>鎧が飾られている…
#. これって本物なのかな…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A suit of armor is on display. Is it authentic...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Một bộ áo giáp đang được trưng bày. Liệu có phải là hàng\n"
"thật không nhỉ...?\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>巻き藁がある…
#. 本物を見るのってこれが初めてだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's a straw post used for sword practice. I've never\n"
"actually seen one for real before...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>遠くに的が見える。
#. いや、近いと成り立たないけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That target seems pretty far away. Although I guess\n"
"that's the point, huh...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0008 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0009 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>Rời khỏi đây?\n"
"<CLT>"
